WEBVTT

00:03:59.311 --> 00:04:02.611
After four years, 
what began as an empowering revolution

00:04:02.611 --> 00:04:05.491
had isolated many influential Burkinabes.

00:04:05.491 --> 00:04:08.817
But Sankara was not ready 
to yield his power.

00:04:08.817 --> 00:04:11.707
He executed 
increasingly authoritarian actions,

00:04:11.707 --> 00:04:15.437
including banning trade unions 
and the free press.

00:04:15.437 --> 00:04:17.927
Eventually, his autocratic tendencies

00:04:17.927 --> 00:04:20.967
turned even his closest friends 
against him.

00:04:20.967 --> 00:04:23.927
On October 15, 1987,

00:04:23.927 --> 00:04:26.837
Sankara was conducting a meeting 
when a group of assailants

00:04:26.837 --> 00:04:28.797
swarmed his headquarters.

00:04:28.797 --> 00:04:31.307
Sankara was assassinated in the attack,